// USEFUL INFO FOR THE APP

SERVER PORTS ->
  auth http server:         3000
  user socket server:       3001
  dashboard socket server:  3002
  chat&forum socket server: 3003
  pandora AI tensor server: 3004
  pay http server:          3005
  object socket server:     3006

GCC ->
  VM-IP: <VM_IP>
  Domain: <YOUR_DOMAIN>
  Application domain: <YOUR_APP_SUBDOMAIN>

NGINX ->
  Config file: /etc/nginx/sites-available/<YOUR_DOMAIN>
  Website runs at: www.<YOUR_DOMAIN>
  Observe UI runs at: www.<YOUR_APP_SUBDOMAIN>
  Microservices runs at: <YOUR_APP_SUBDOMAIN> +
    /auth = (auth http server)
    /memb = (user socket server)
    /dash = (dashboard socket server)
    /chfm = (chat$forum socket server)
    /pand = (pandora AI server)
    /fin  = (finance http server)
    /obj  = (object socket server)


PM2 ->
  Ecosystem config file: /var/www/observe/ecosystem.config.js
  a) to start / stop ecosystem
  pm2 start/stop ecosystem.config.js


/////////////////////
USEFUL COMMANDS ->
sudo lsof -i:<PORT_NO> (check PID of port in use)
sudo kill <PID> (kill PID in port)
